        },
        50
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "number"}
        },
        60
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "number"}
        },
        70
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "number"}
        },
        80
    ]
]
```
These inputs cover a wide range of scenarios, including arrays with different sums and lengths. The first five test cases have the sum of the array elements less than or equal to `w`, while the remaining five test cases have the sum greater than `w`. This should expose any issues related to the comparison of the sum of the array elements with `w` in the Java version.
